    [15010017] = {
        id = 15010017,
        text = "1. In Demon King Trials, you can accept challenges of Demon Kings and complete them to get huge rewards.\n2. Demon King Trials open every week from Tuesday to Sunday with a truce day on Monday. Stage and Extra Affixes will be changed randomly each time. \n3. Demon King Trials are divided into Base Group: Lv.30-50, Middle Group: Lv.51-60, Top Group: Lv.61-80. The strength of Demon Kings will vary based on your level. \n4. Extra affixes exist in Demon King Stages. After clearing each stage, its extra affixes will take effect in the other uncleared stages. So the order to challenges stages matters. \n5. After clearing a stage, points will be calculated based on your clear time. \n6. There are two types of rewards. Individual Reward: Reward claimed based on challenge status in current phase, this will be reset in each phase. Achievement Reward: Reward claimed based on challenge history, can be claimed once and won't be reset. \n7. In each phase, 3 random spirits will receive random enhancement in your challenges. \n8. In each phase, two stages will give 20% extra points.",
