    [13200677] = {
        id = 13200677,
        text = "Notice: welcome to the ancient capital, where many secrets waiting for you to explore!\n\n1. Stronghold: \nThere are 9 strongholds to explore: West Gate, North Bridge, Shrine, Wild Field, Barn, Great Hall, Flower Street, Watchtower and Altar. \nDispatch a team to explore, then claim exploration reward and increase exploration completion. \nAfter completing an exploration, the stronghold will close and another stronghold will appear. Players can also manually refresh and replace the stronghold that is not explored, refresh chances reset at 0:00 every day. \nExploration terminated midway won't give any reward. \n2. Exploring Bonus: \nExploring bonus is divided into [Location] bonus and [Bonds] bonus (Location bonus increases based on corresponding spirit's Rank Level). Use bonus wisely to improve exploration revenue effectively. \n3. Support Character: \nPlayers can set Support Character in [Character] page and get gold reward based on support duration. Club members can borrow support character from each other (support character provides [Location] bonus but not [Bonds] bonus.) Can only borrow 1 support at a time, up to 3 times per day, quota resets at 0:00 every day. Each borrow costs some gold, and the owner will get support duration reward (eligible up to 20 times per day), which will be sent via mail after event ends. \n4. Quest: A series of daily quests will be provided during the event. Daily quests can be reset once every 24 hours. \n\n5. End of Event: \nThe event ends at 23:59 on July 11th. After that time, no new stronghold will be refreshed, and support duration reward stops accumulating (can still explore and submit quest).",
        minipack = 0,
    },
